6</year><volume>20</volume><fpage>1394</fpage><lpage>1404</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1101/gad.1424006</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Willert K, Jones KA (2006) Wnt signaling: is the party in the nucleus? Genes Dev 20:1394&#x02013;1404. doi:10.1101/gad.1424006 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16751178</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>